{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sheepherds!</strong></i> is a friendly and playful co-op game for up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your sheepdog buddies and guide fluffy flocks through colorful flower fields to dye their wool\u2026and make cool clothes for you and your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and have fun barking, running, and discovering magical places together \u2014 or take on challenges to win treats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the flock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheep follow and influence each other, just like in real life. Learn to manage them like a good sheepdog, by positioning yourself strategically and barking at just the right moment! Or, just do whatever: after all, you\u2019re a dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.poster.avif?t=1757489500\" width=580 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.webm?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.mp4?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A relaxing co-op game for everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Sheepherds! </i></strong>was designed to be a friendly, relaxing co-op experience. No mandatory task-sharing, no peer pressure, no time limit \u2014 enjoy an experience where your actions can only have positive effects. Stay friends with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2445faf65b0b83d441518ecf17f30ff7.poster.avif?t=1757489500\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2445faf65b0b83d441518ecf17f30ff7.webm?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spice it up with optional challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add an extra layer of depth with optional challenges designed to test your skills and teamwork. Will you become the top dog and master every challenge, or are you just looking to vibe with your friends? Either way is okay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.poster.avif?t=1757489500\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.webm?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.mp4?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not just any dog - <i>your</i> dog</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your well-earned treats into exciting rewards! Unlock a variety of stylish accessories, colorful outfits and unique skins to personalize your sheepdog. Mix and match your favorite combinations to create a look that perfectly reflects your style and makes your dog stand out in the flock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/eec7ac30cc3953ace5ef66e0caef7530.poster.avif?t=1757489500\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/eec7ac30cc3953ace5ef66e0caef7530.webm?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/eec7ac30cc3953ace5ef66e0caef7530.mp4?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3006280?t=1757489500","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757489500","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/dbefeae48c85af778f87f9b090b615b5f72f0aea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757489500","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/dbefeae48c85af778f87f9b090b615b5f72f0aea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757489500","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3450210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Keyboard Guide</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sheepherds!</i> is best enjoyed <strong>with a controller,</strong> but here\u2019s a quick guide in case you need to use a keyboard:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/8a96c7d97786afcb6cd7c546bf48b843.avif?t=1757489500\" width=900 height=440 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sheepherds!</strong></i> is a friendly and playful co-op game for up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your sheepdog buddies and guide fluffy flocks through colorful flower fields to dye their wool\u2026and make cool clothes for you and your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and have fun barking, running, and discovering magical places together \u2014 or take on challenges to win treats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the flock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheep follow and influence each other, just like in real life. Learn to manage them like a good sheepdog, by positioning yourself strategically and barking at just the right moment! Or, just do whatever: after all, you\u2019re a dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.poster.avif?t=1757489500\" width=580 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.webm?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.mp4?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A relaxing co-op game for everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Sheepherds! </i></strong>was designed to be a friendly, relaxing co-op experience. No mandatory task-sharing, no peer pressure, no time limit \u2014 enjoy an experience where your actions can only have positive effects. Stay friends with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2445faf65b0b83d441518ecf17f30ff7.poster.avif?t=1757489500\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2445faf65b0b83d441518ecf17f30ff7.webm?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spice it up with optional challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add an extra layer of depth with optional challenges designed to test your skills and teamwork. Will you become the top dog and master every challenge, or are you just looking to vibe with your friends? Either way is okay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.poster.avif?t=1757489500\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.webm?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.mp4?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not just any dog - <i>your</i> dog</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your well-earned treats into exciting rewards! Unlock a variety of stylish accessories, colorful outfits and unique skins to personalize your sheepdog. Mix and match your favorite combinations to create a look that perfectly reflects your style and makes your dog stand out in the flock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/eec7ac30cc3953ace5ef66e0caef7530.poster.avif?t=1757489500\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/eec7ac30cc3953ace5ef66e0caef7530.webm?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/eec7ac30cc3953ace5ef66e0caef7530.mp4?t=1757489500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ultimo Disco"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/header.jpg?t=1757489500","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257094340,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094340/movie480.mp4?t=1748451433","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094340/movie_max.mp4?t=1748451433"},"name":"Trailer-EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257094340/e9478eb3a8ecb03dbb7f101a3ae74435ae136406/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748451433","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094340/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748451433","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094340/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748451433"}}],"name":"Sheepherds!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li>